## ✅ CORRECT PATTERNS

### RGV Patterns (see `@01_Guidance.mdc §1` for full definition)
```
✅ RE-READ relevant artifact files fresh BEFORE generating each section
✅ INVENTORY: Count elements, COMMIT to N before generating
✅ GENERATE: Produce exactly N items
✅ VERIFY: Count generated items = N before proceeding
✅ FIX: If mismatch → RE-READ, find missing, fix
✅ CHECKPOINT: Emit micro-checkpoint with N/N counts
```

### Extraction Patterns
```
✅ Read EACH artifact file using Read tool
✅ Phase 0: Read ALL files for classification + build reading plan with counts
✅ Phase 1: Per-FLOW RGV loop for Section 3.x
✅ Phase 2: Per-NDF RGV loop for Section 4.x + mapping tables
✅ Phase 3: Per-WSDL/XSD/DocType/IDF RGV loop for Section 5.x
✅ Phase 4: Per-ACL/JAVA/config RGV loop for Section 6.x
✅ Phase 5: Synthesize from Phases 1-4, RE-READ as needed
✅ Phase 6: RE-READ every artifact file for verification
✅ Classify NDF from content attributes (not path)
✅ Detect extensionless WSDL by reading content
✅ Document ALL NDF fields (mapped AND unmapped)
✅ Document ALL mapping rows individually
✅ Include ALL ACL entries with runtime impact
```

### Output Patterns
```
✅ Verification counts ONLY in verification-checklist.md
✅ ALL mapping rows in supporting-docs/mapping-tables.md
✅ ALL flow steps in main document Section 3 with connectivity embedded per component
✅ Detailed configs in supporting-docs/flow-configuration.md
✅ Reference format: > **📄 Details:** See [`supporting-docs/...`](supporting-docs/...)
```

### Workflow Patterns
```
✅ "Here's the project folder. Please confirm to proceed."
✅ [Wait for single confirmation at Phase 0]
✅ Process Phases 1-4 continuously with micro-checkpoints
✅ Phase checkpoint between phases (no waiting except Phase 0 and Phase 5)
✅ STOP at Phase 5 for user review of synthesis
✅ STOP at Phase 6 for user acceptance of certification
✅ Present final summary with file list and micro-checkpoint rollup
```

